{"id":613,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"自己評価と表現を重ねる長崎日大の学び","feature_description":"長崎日本大学中学校のクリエイトコースは、校訓に基づく十のパフォーマンス課題に取り組みます。各課題は四段階のルーブリックで示され、学期末に自分の到達度を振り返り、キャリアパスポートに記録します。目指す姿への距離を定期的に確かめ、六年間の成長を実感できる仕組みを通して、自ら学びを見直し次の目標へ進む姿勢を育てています。段階別の評価を用い、到達度を確かめながら学びを積み重ねます。","clubs":[{"id":14545,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://nagasaki-nichidai.jp/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/R08_%E9%95%B7%E5%B4%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A4%A7%E4%B8%AD_%E5%AD%A6%E6%A0%A1%E6%A1%88%E5%86%85.pdf","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14546,"name":"軟式野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://nagasaki-nichidai.jp/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/R08_%E9%95%B7%E5%B4%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A4%A7%E4%B8%AD_%E5%AD%A6%E6%A0%A1%E6%A1%88%E5%86%85.pdf","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14547,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://nagasaki-nichidai.jp/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/R08_%E9%95%B7%E5%B4%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A4%A7%E4%B8%AD_%E5%AD%A6%E6%A0%A1%E6%A1%88%E5%86%85.pdf","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14548,"name":"空手道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://nagasaki-nichidai.jp/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/R08_%E9%95%B7%E5%B4%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A4%A7%E4%B8%AD_%E5%AD%A6%E6%A0%A1%E6%A1%88%E5%86%85.pdf","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14549,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://nagasaki-nichidai.jp/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/R08_%E9%95%B7%E5%B4%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A4%A7%E4%B8%AD_%E5%AD%A6%E6%A0%A1%E6%A1%88%E5%86%85.pdf","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14550,"name":"柔道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://nagasaki-nichidai.jp/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/R08_%E9%95%B7%E5%B4%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A4%A7%E4%B8%AD_%E5%AD%A6%E6%A0%A1%E6%A1%88%E5%86%85.pdf","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14551,"name":"テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://nagasaki-nichidai.jp/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/R08_%E9%95%B7%E5%B4%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%A4%A7%E4%B8%AD_%E5%AD%A6%E6%A0%A1%E6%A1%88%E5%86%85.p